<!--
  Custom Wazuh rules for this lab.

  Deploy to:  /var/ossec/etc/rules/local_rules.xml
  Test with:  /var/ossec/bin/wazuh-logtest
  Apply with: sudo systemctl restart wazuh-manager

  Custom rule IDs must be in the 100000-199999 range. IDs below that are
  reserved for the default ruleset and will be overwritten on upgrade.

  Levels used here:
    0      Ignored / suppressed (used for tuning out false positives)
    3-5    Informational, atomic events
    7-9    Noteworthy, worth reviewing
    10-12  Actionable, correlation or high-confidence single event
    13+    Critical
-->

